{"id":"92f365ec0f2e26f3","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-normal-fixed-points.md","title":"正规函数的不动点迭代与闭性","display":"thm-normal-fixed-points — 正规函数的不动点迭代与闭性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-normal-fixed-points","aliases":["18-thm-normal-fixed-points"],"display":"thm-normal-fixed-points — 正规函数的不动点迭代与闭性","depends_on":["[[18-df-normal-function]]","[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"Lemma 3.2.13; Lemma 3.4.2","source_printed_pages":"26, 35","source_pdf_pages":"36, 45","source_correspondence":"full-class-version-with-local-least-fixed-point-refinement","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","verification_status":"source-proof-checked-with-local-full-class-proof"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-normal-fixed-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-normal-fixed-points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-normal-fixed-points — 正规函数的不动点迭代与闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83adc13498d19c2f\" href=\"?note=83adc13498d19c2f\" title=\"18-df-normal-function\">18-df-normal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemma 3.2.13; Lemma 3.4.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"26, 35"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"36, 45"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"full-class-version-with-local-least-fixed-point-refinement"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-checked-with-local-full-class-proof"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为可定义全类函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83adc13498d19c2f\" href=\"?note=83adc13498d19c2f\" title=\"18-df-normal-function\">18-df-normal-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a>。类函数参数及其图均为元理论缩写，不对真类作集合量化。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;\\omega\">\\(n&lt;\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{succ}\">\\(\\operatorname{succ}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\alpha\">\\(f,\\alpha\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{f,\\alpha}:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(b_{f,\\alpha}:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 由下列自然数递归引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f\">\\(c_f\\)</span> 为下式定义的可定义序数类函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 在下式中只取集合值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_{f,\\alpha}(0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha),\\qquad\nb_{f,\\alpha}(n+1)\\coloneqq f(b_{f,\\alpha}(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_{f,\\alpha}(0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha),\\qquad\nb_{f,\\alpha}(n+1)\\coloneqq f(b_{f,\\alpha}(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_f(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{b_{f,\\alpha}(n):n&lt;\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_f(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{b_{f,\\alpha}(n):n&lt;\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi\\le f(\\xi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi\\le f(\\xi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;c_f(\\alpha)\\land c_f(\\alpha)\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land\n\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\eta\\to c_f(\\alpha)\\le\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha&lt;c_f(\\alpha)\\land c_f(\\alpha)\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land\n\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\eta\\to c_f(\\alpha)\\le\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U\\;\\bigl(U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land U\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to\\sup U\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U\\;\\bigl(U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land U\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to\\sup U\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已读 Lemma 3.2.13 的最小反例证明及 Lemma 3.4.2 的迭代、闭性证明。本节点使用现有 Normal 的全序数类签名，直接给出全类版本的本地论证，不把它伪称为书中任意 κ 的逐字命题。</p>\n<p>严格递增函数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\le f(\\xi)\">\\(\\xi\\le f(\\xi)\\)</span>：若存在最小反例 ξ，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\xi)&lt;\\xi\">\\(f(\\xi)&lt;\\xi\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(f(\\xi))&lt;f(\\xi)\">\\(f(f(\\xi))&lt;f(\\xi)\\)</span>，产生更小反例。故 b 列非降，且其上确界严格大于 α。若某一步稳定，该稳定值已是不动点；否则 b 列严格递增，上确界是非零极限，连续性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\sup_n b_n)=\\sup_n f(b_n)=\\sup_n b_{n+1}=\\sup_n b_n\">\\(f(\\sup_n b_n)=\\sup_n f(b_n)=\\sup_n b_{n+1}=\\sup_n b_n\\)</span>。这也覆盖恒等函数，不能把全部迭代一概当作严格递增。任一大于 α 的不动点 η 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0\\le\\eta\">\\(b_0\\le\\eta\\)</span>，逐项归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_n\\le\\eta\">\\(b_n\\le\\eta\\)</span>，故 c 为最小这样的不动点。</p>\n<p>非空不动点集合 U 若有最大元，结论立即成立；否则其上确界 λ 是非零极限，U 在 λ 中共尾，由单调性和连续性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\lambda)=\\sup f[U]=\\sup U=\\lambda\">\\(f(\\lambda)=\\sup f[U]=\\sup U=\\lambda\\)</span>。递归在集合 ω 上进行，Replacement 保证 b 的值集及上确界为集合序数；没有对全部不动点类取集合上确界。</p>\n<p>新增前已查本目录全部原子及 glossary；Fix 节点只有定义，021/epsilon0 只有 ω 幂特例，尚无一般正规函数不动点的可复用迭代与闭性节点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-normal-function","status":"resolved","id":"83adc13498d19c2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-normal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-normal-function","status":"resolved","id":"83adc13498d19c2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为可定义全类函数，$\\mathrm{Normal}(f)$，见 [[18-df-normal-function]]；$\\mathrm{Fix}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]。类函数参数及其图均为元理论缩写，不对真类作集合量化。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为可定义全类函数，$\\mathrm{Normal}(f)$，见 [[18-df-normal-function]]；$\\mathrm{Fix}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]。类函数参数及其图均为元理论缩写，不对真类作集合量化。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$；$\\operatorname{succ}$ 见 [[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。对给定 $f,\\alpha$，$b_{f,\\alpha}:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 由下列自然数递归引入；$c_f$ 为下式定义的可定义序数类函数。$U$ 在下式中只取集合值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"n<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{succ}","display":false},{"tex":"f,\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"b_{f,\\alpha}:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"c_f","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"b_{f,\\alpha}(0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha),\\qquad\nb_{f,\\alpha}(n+1)\\coloneqq f(b_{f,\\alpha}(n)).","display":true},{"tex":"c_f(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{b_{f,\\alpha}(n):n<\\omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi\\le f(\\xi)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha<c_f(\\alpha)\\land c_f(\\alpha)\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land\n\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\;(\\alpha<\\eta\\to c_f(\\alpha)\\le\\eta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall U\\;\\bigl(U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land U\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to\\sup U\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\xi\\le f(\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\xi)<\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"f(f(\\xi))<f(\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\sup_n b_n)=\\sup_n f(b_n)=\\sup_n b_{n+1}=\\sup_n b_n","display":false},{"tex":"b_0\\le\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"b_n\\le\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\lambda)=\\sup f[U]=\\sup U=\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":3179,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-normal-fixed-points]]"},{"id":"86c6b889a83607ba","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f'$ 为下式引入的导函数，其图为可定义类，不作为集合函数量化。不动点类的无界性及非空集合上确界闭性见 [[18-thm-normal-fixed-points]]；$\\operatorname{succ}$ 见 [[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-normal-fixed-points]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-normal-fixed-points]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-normal-fixed-points|18-thm-normal-fixed-points]]"}],"outgoing":["83adc13498d19c2f","779baa2ce0d8c0d8","dbde69396a089d39"]}